# Dicksonia antarctica Labill. (Soft Tree Fern)
# Taxon concept, pteridophyte / Dicksoniaceae anatomical subsystems (PO:*),
# caudex-rosette & rachis-pinna allometry, post-fire apical crozier survival,
# InstanceState64 ontogenetic parameter bounds, ecological interactions (RO:*),
# and South-Eastern Australian Biocultural Country provenance (SPC / Local Contexts).
#
# Evidence boundary (per tree-cases.md):
# Taxonomic, morphological, and biophysical traits below represent sourced working
# reference bounds across cool-temperate rainforests and wet-sclerophyll mountain
# gullies in South-Eastern Australia (VIC, TAS, NSW, ACT, SE QLD; working focus:
# Victorian Central Highlands / Yarra Ranges & Otway Ranges, and Tasmanian gullies).
# Exact site and individual occurrence identification remain pending field resolution.

